Third-party material

This product bundles third-party material under its own licenses, listed below. The per-file
list (author, source, license) is in ATTRIBUTION.md.

Google Fonts index (compiled in through craft-font-store) — generated by
github.com/aiongg/google-fonts-index from the METADATA.pb files of github.com/google/fonts and the
gflanguages data, both Apache License 2.0. The index lists fonts; it contains no font files. Each
font the app downloads is under the licence its family names (SIL Open Font License 1.1, Apache
License 2.0 or the Ubuntu Font Licence 1.0), and the font store installs that licence file beside it.
